# THE CANONICAL SHARED-REGION DIGESTS.
#
# fleet/templates/tests/test_release_wiring.sh and
# fleet/templates/tests/test_wiring_mutations.sh are COPIED, in full,
# into every repository that adopts the shared release guards. Copies
# drift, and a drifted copy still reports success. The fleet has been
# bitten by exactly this twice: a capability tuple hand-copied at 21
# sites in this repository that had already drifted before anyone
# looked, and capa_authgate's check_tag_version.sh becoming a second
# copy whose two versions immediately printed different messages.
#
# Each of those files is split by two marker lines into a CONFIG region,
# which is repo-specific by design, and everything else, which is meant
# to be byte-identical everywhere. This file records the SHA-256 of
# everything OUTSIDE the config region, markers included, for each
# template as it stands here.
#
# The paths are the paths an ADOPTER sees. The canonical file is the
# same path under fleet/templates/, which is the mapping the adopter
# check applies to fetch it.
#
# WHO READS THIS:
#
#   * tests/test_fleet_templates.py, offline, which runs the real
#     adopter-side check against these templates and refuses any
#     disagreement with the numbers below;
#   * every adopter's .github/shared-regions.sha256, which copies these
#     numbers and adds a `revision` line naming the commit they were
#     copied from. That revision is INDEPENDENT of the guard pin in
#     .github/guard-pins.sha256, on purpose: one shared revision would
#     make every guard bump force a wiring re-audit and every wiring
#     bump force a guard re-audit, and that friction is the likeliest
#     reason for the whole exercise to be skipped.
#
# TO REGENERATE AFTER A DELIBERATE CHANGE TO A TEMPLATE:
#
#   bash fleet/shared_region_digest.sh
#
# Then bump each adopter's record, revision line included, which is what
# makes the change an adoption rather than a drift.

16364eedf7bb6380c6d4156139acceec80dad0ae6f5cae5bfae3f67b3dbeee85  tests/test_release_wiring.sh
f703c855c94cd5cec4e6502258c307cc5f3f0747b8b12ca906c6890727c2a745  tests/test_wiring_mutations.sh
